#: scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8996bafd497f1c98b02662adedc38be3970a8bf1983f817a4a7c1af906bfd952
#. default-sha256: 4479e08ff914a8449461dff95d0046896b491b8bc51185af56bdebf3d6abdef7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47057BF5_44DC_41D6_8017_7B2CAE4C05CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t work on some nobleman’s estate,⟪k:1⟫but instead, I did physical labor—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"construction work.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I built roads and buildings, tore down hills and mountains."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어디 저택에서 노동하는 노예가 아니라, ⟪k:1⟫도로나 건물을 지을 때…… 산을 깎을 때 이용됐지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 601170e4974f57d7bd6aff9f759f84f43ca77a2ceffd3dc577d9671123c57c2d
#. default-sha256: 4705487a988c60de5f607cc5a8e934c984e3fbf6493bf06307b5dd0e0a6068c3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_45FD88B4_AA76_42DE_94CD_DE73FCD1A352"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while I doubt I need to tell you this, living conditions were miserable. ⟪k:1⟫Other "
"slaves withered away and died on a daily basis."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫굳이 말할 필요도 없겠는데…… 열악한 생활이었다. ⟪k:1⟫다른 노예는 하나같이 지쳐 죽었지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bb3208f69caa6ec20d637321b9bfae351df95db4d79d58b4a00c7d77e0b32f8
#. default-sha256: e1286ede69bc877b05f682d34cf628bfaf118be50276f4443062dac58b25c1bf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_12FF52C4_7EBC_4641_BDF4_64368F767F58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Working a noble’s estate would have been easier, without a doubt,⟪k:1⟫if only for the fact I "
"would have a specific master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫차라리…… 어디 저택에서 노동하는 게 ⟪k:1⟫주인이 있으니 ⟪k:2⟫편했을 것 같군."

#: scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28a1325897813fcfd31f3602390d679d6b0d1da9b4487db3ac7eff2a90288538
#. default-sha256: 36f646277ccff4c6adc372e23193295c9d4ac4dda8c9242b4577212de91e1623
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_534C0ED0_582D_42BB_B166_3AFB1F40CF0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t remember anything about my life before becoming a slave.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All I have are "
"those few images, from which I can guess I was part of a caravan,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫노예 이전의 기억은 없는데…… ⟪k:1⟫어렴풋이 기억하는 바에 따르면 ⟪k:2⟫나는 어디 상단에 소속되었"
"거나――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baef723aa6b067d2a211e8313310e073c457e74ffa746698a9291245423b88e7
#. default-sha256: 29556ce9a5a72c4aaee241e37d00e61419b61b87c49be755dfb9d63404e6fe4e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_63BF9B0D_C271_4399_B567_890C007FD834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I next woke up, I had been stripped bare and was surrounded by men I didn’t recognize. "
"⟪k:1⟫The words they spoke were gibberish to my ears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어느새 가진 걸 탈탈 털렸고, ⟪k:1⟫주위에는 낯선 남자들이 있었다. ⟪k:2⟫그 자들의 말은 ⟪k:3⟫하나"
"도 알아들을 수 없었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D06F54B4_185B_46AE_B6E6_F141A5CF6BAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26b1a66ab762124f98a3cf451faa9cebdc9d25acefe227cbbad7f1879eca1393
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D06F54B4_185B_46AE_B6E6_F141A5CF6BAD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e490ae901b8f980463ffcd02cc8a7c4d457a5322dda9e0431851832505c6102d
#. default-sha256: 4dcfe3d784310a54cf4dc3a3bcaf77aca703a4da7418199dbeaeb78ef5326ac6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AB108AB8_AA28_450D_AE9A_53D970552B95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, I came to learn their language—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫though I can only speak it; ⟪k:4⟫I "
"don’t know how to read or write."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……나는 지금도 문자를 거의 모르지만, ⟪k:1⟫노예로 지내며 ⟪k:2⟫놈들의 말을 학습하는 건 가능했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d5e1b7028ef94074bfdd47ed1afc039cec4036d34d812209197d154b08b264c
#. default-sha256: 04ab21d2bba822f58cd1fe78c6079a2ab87e6d73b1eddc457395e760326957bd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5546A0EE_64F6_4344_B502_11EFE882CDB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A darkness grew inside me with each repeated insult.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wanted to make them pay for "
"the daily abuse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫핍박받는 나날 속에서 ⟪k:1⟫내 안에 거무칙칙한 것이 점점 쌓여 갔다. ⟪k:2⟫놈들에게 대들고 싶었"
"지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15dfaeacb07baccbbce91fc747b75e8429121a103fedb9ecc42dd8cb42ff24bd
#. default-sha256: 76ed4d22004f2e17c623b537001b6aa530a6bcef00c640bc34a6c672006cb1ac
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_32D303D1_C03A_4E23_8477_EDF7C7EF30C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And who wouldn’t? The desire to exact vengeance when you’ve been mistreated is only natural. "
"It’s perfectly reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그건 당연한 감정 아니겠나? ⟪k:1⟫나를 핍박한 자들에게 복수하여 ⟪k:2⟫나와 똑같거나―― 더 큰 고통"
"을 주고 싶단 감정……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd5404faa229448ea198cdcceca483f0da41ab3012f020fac9d0eb2e46dca86e
#. default-sha256: 26f89ec05a2923fb0000448d9469fd4a9e09e8d6c40b55a5c74b53538cb324b7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ADF8CDC2_78C4_4165_9B48_6BFD50A39D0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They looked like me a year earlier: ⟪k:1⟫deprived of food and water and beaten into "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫노예가 된 직후의 나와 똑같은 거지……, ⟪k:1⟫식량을 빼앗기고 ⟪k:2⟫폭력을 당하면 ⟪k:3⟫얌전해질 수"
"밖에 없다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71d0c7ffc50b29d651c1859318a59995d97f289789f57024f09e887a549dce48
#. default-sha256: 86e8da6e9e79684ebdf45c416ccd2cb7f31eed4fb9d2e36ee85422ec650c7941
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_835310F6_069D_4F34_A775_EF2F3EFBA66F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sitting beside me was a young girl, crying in silence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 안에 ⟪k:1⟫소리 없이 눈물을 흘리는 소녀가 있었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내 옆에 가만히 앉은 채로 말이"
"다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d70d5ccbb1c9a8113b46fdc096cd3ab4dddc112299b48d05f483549bed878e55
#. default-sha256: 982891b11bbe9c8bffbebe18039bb793c81d4f1f082a25495ca4becb997b5f9c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8E5AB87_D69C_4058_8B8F_F515CEB1EB83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫perhaps because I had a similarly unusual appearance.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What caught my attention, "
"though, was the way she was crying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나도 남들이 보기엔 ⟪k:1⟫기묘한 외견일 거거든.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 걸리던 건…… 그 녀석이 울던 분위기"
"다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11909b2d8e52bdd28e78257fc8457f79ec1d45d3dc6eadcbc5413a67b26f1af0
#. default-sha256: 58185115bd30efafddb4f26d0d71dd95826486e2f293bbe8239ea5d18b8e24d6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EBD60DDB_4658_44B8_B36C_062F56D7DFCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To this day, I still don’t understand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 지금도…… 그때 그 말이 ⟪k:1⟫이해가 안 된다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0e3adcddc342bf39750a223d43cf2e6ad04536167d14e5958a37a9d53db6324
#. default-sha256: 343172600ab008ede4096792be2ece7c4492e4307b3f57ece50ef2064b977f40
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2B84FADB_83B3_45E7_A6EC_B74CE1F75E91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so I took action, driven by that desire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 순간은 그 생각만 하며…… ⟪k:1⟫행동에 나섰다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB056D07_1356_41C0_84A8_F4DD8B0136A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 443f2bda6b56f797eecac8c260d3d24ed3dcd2866358cd1cbfeebba1feb2695b
#. default-sha256: 4af26bcbe848057b029425dbdf6af44fd8b12e62ddbcb2ebf93f34ed122b5526
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BB056D07_1356_41C0_84A8_F4DD8B0136A2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫No... ⟪k:4⟫no, don’t kill me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫머……, ⟪k:3⟫멈춰……, ⟪k:4⟫주, ⟪k:5⟫죽이지 마……!!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9166C886_262C_4544_AD28_298AE84AB18A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33a20dfee650170051e4495c3af7a47a605fa406a638797fa9a6a0198c7cf068
#. default-sha256: a50e72190b565399bdb3f1827bac8bf95d22c0cd0042c6f64af810d04f0adec2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9166C886_262C_4544_AD28_298AE84AB18A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Haha..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………하하………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A894CB19_55BF_49D4_A0D2_89C365A1867B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90c857b599850fa1590894983ec2e4656478706bb5ae19663eb6fadfb1a6225b
#. default-sha256: dac4d7553a2b8950798b001506d952e77e2c740b66115ea412345a89fb9b64dc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A894CB19_55BF_49D4_A0D2_89C365A1867B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Heh heh... ⟪k:1⟫heh heh heh...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫hahahaha... ⟪k:4⟫AAAAAAAHAHAHAHA!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫흐흐……, ⟪k:1⟫흐흡…… 하하하하……, ⟪k:2⟫아앗하하하하……!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DEC2EA83_12F0_4863_BF43_878D97A2F0EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d206b08cb6e27cc8647bf303bea567c1c6be06713ee75669f1a58e1967601bc0
#. default-sha256: ffed8e9f6c7e3ee3f4951203009c2525263c5613e79cbee5dbfa38f8ad8d3ab6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DEC2EA83_12F0_4863_BF43_878D97A2F0EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I have a wife... ⟪k:2⟫and children! Please!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나, ⟪k:1⟫나는…… 아내랑 아이가 있어……, ⟪k:2⟫그러니 제발………!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_298B5185_05D6_4808_99AD_A2B0277FD14E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ebf20c313b4ce96ee258d418beb826dbe379fd646f082f0e6190116e2ea4531
#. default-sha256: 006368d18b2398189d58579c574af8d2e73e743806b71111ef2de67049696d71
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_298B5185_05D6_4808_99AD_A2B0277FD14E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even with the shackles still around my wrists, I had little trouble slaughtering the slave "
"traders and their guards."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫수갑이 채워졌어도―― ⟪k:1⟫나는 노예상인과 호위들을 몰살하는 데 성공했거든……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DDB36FD1_459A_41A4_BDCD_13E71889DFF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9593a90cd695b5fb652a8dbd553f7ae8a3960f13dc5c3ca68bbdfcf3e38b925
#. default-sha256: e01931f574e3a376868c7f3bed6fcdfb4488014218aebd00128d31e1f9d29472
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DDB36FD1_459A_41A4_BDCD_13E71889DFF8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See? No one can defeat me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무도…… 나를 못 이겼는데……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_965C61DA_0A90_4324_BF7B_37434EA96B28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
